#. module: appointment_google_calendar
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:appointment_google_calendar.field_appointment_type__event_videocall_source
msgid ""
"Defines the type of video call link that will be used for the generated "
"events.\n"
"\n"
"            Can be one of:\n"
"                - Odoo Discuss: Generates an internal Odoo Discuss meeting "
"link.\n"
"                - Google Meet: Generates a Google Meet link. Requires Google "
"Calendar synchronization to be configured and active. If the staff user did "
"not synchronize their calendar, no Google Meet link will be added to their "
"meetings.\n"
"\n"
"            Keep it empty to prevent generating meeting url."
msgstr ""
"Definerer typen af link til videoopkald, der anvendes ved oprettelse af "
"arrangementer.\n"
"\n"
"            Kan være en af følgende:\n"
"                - Odoo Dialog: Genererer et internt Odoo Dialog-mødelink.\n"
"                - Google Meet: Genererer et Google Meet-link. Kræver, at "
"synkronisering med Google Kalender er konfigureret og aktiv. Hvis brugeren "
"ikke har synkroniseret sin kalender, tilføjes der ikke et Google Meet-link "
"til brugerens møder.\n"
"\n"
"            Lad feltet være tomt for at forhindre generering af en møde-URL."

